# ==============================================================================
# FileMate — Monorepo Environment Configuration Guide
# ==============================================================================
# In accordance with OWASP LLM02 and enterprise security standards,
# credentials and secrets are strictly isolated per sub-project:
#
# 1. Backend environment file:
#    cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
#    (Holds DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET_KEY, AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY, etc.)
#
# 2. Frontend environment file:
#    cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env
#    (Holds VITE_API_BASE_URL — ZERO secrets or API keys)
#
# NEVER commit .env, private keys, or secret credentials to version control.
# ==============================================================================
